---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { monthlyPrice } from '../config';
---
<Layout title="Pricing" description="Tumblebase launch pricing and what to expect from club subscriptions and payment processing.">
  <section class="wrap py-16 lg:py-24"><p class="eyebrow">Clear costs for your club</p><h1 class="mt-5 max-w-3xl font-display text-5xl leading-tight sm:text-6xl">A clear plan for<br />the club budget.</h1><p class="prose-copy mt-6 max-w-xl">Club software and payment processing are separate costs. You should be able to see both before deciding.</p>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><section class="rounded-3xl bg-forest p-8 text-paper sm:p-10"><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sage">Club subscription</p>{monthlyPrice ? <p class="mt-5 text-5xl font-semibold">£{monthlyPrice}<span class="ml-2 text-base font-normal text-paper/80">per month</span></p> : <h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-4xl">Launch pricing<br />is being finalised.</h2>}<p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-paper/80">{monthlyPrice ? 'Payment processing fees are separate. Founding-club terms are confirmed before you join.' : 'We will publish the subscription price and founding-club terms here before paid sign-ups open.'}</p><a href="/founding-clubs/" class="button-light mt-8">About founding clubs <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section><section class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-paper p-8 sm:p-10"><p class="eyebrow">Payment processing</p><h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-4xl">Your provider.<br />Your account.</h2><p class="prose-copy mt-6">Direct Debit fees are charged under your club’s agreement with GoCardless. Card processing uses your connected Stripe account. Check the provider’s applicable fees when setting up your club.</p><p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">We will confirm any platform charges as part of the published offer, so you can compare the full cost.</p></section></div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap pb-20"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl">What will be clear before you join?</h2><div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">{[['Subscription', 'The monthly price, any usage limits and how cancellation works.'],['Payment costs', 'Provider processing fees and any applicable platform charges.'],['Getting started', 'The founding-club offer and what help is included with migration.']].map(([title, copy]) => <div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h3 class="font-semibold">{title}</h3><p class="prose-copy mt-3">{copy}</p></div>)}</div></section>
</Layout>
